<main><section class="hero" id="home" aria-label="蝶映穗城主视觉"><div class="hero-art"><img id="main-image" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="用户创作的银灰与浅金针迹蝶形主视觉"><canvas id="hero-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas></div><div class="hero-title"><span class="eyebrow">DIE YING SUI CHENG / 2026</span><h1>蝶映穗城</h1></div><div class="hero-aside">以针迹构形<br>以银光映蝶</div><button class="replay" id="replay">↺ 重演针迹生成</button><div class="hero-bottom"><div><h2>Silver ×<br>Aureus.</h2><p>从一根针迹开始，重新理解蝴蝶纹样。</p></div><a class="scroll-link" href="#identity">向下探索 <span>↓</span></a></div></section>
<section class="section wrap" id="identity"><div class="section-head reveal"><div class="eyebrow">01 / Visual identity</div><h2>让颜色退后。<br>让材质说话。<small>视觉规范 / COLOUR & TYPOGRAPHY</small></h2></div><div class="intro-line reveal"><span class="eyebrow muted">A quiet material language</span><p>米白承接纸张的温度，银灰描绘针迹的秩序。浅金只在细节中出现，回应蝶翼上的金斑。</p></div><div class="palette reveal"><div class="swatch"><span>PAPER WHITE</span><b>#FAF9F6</b></div><div class="swatch"><span>SILVER</span><b>#AEB3B8</b></div><div class="swatch"><span>DEEP SILVER</span><b>#747A80</b></div><div class="swatch"><span>AUREUS</span><b>#C9AF7B</b></div><div class="swatch"><span>INK</span><b>#252525</b></div></div><p class="palette-note">基底 · 暖米白 #F3EFE8　 /　浅金为局部点缀，建议占比约 5%</p><div class="type-grid reveal"><div class="type-sample"><span class="eyebrow">中文 / Source Han Sans SC</span><strong>针迹之间，<br>蝶影浮现。</strong><p>标准中文：思源黑体 · 标题 300 / 正文 400 / 强调 500</p></div><div class="type-sample"><span class="eyebrow">Latin / Helvetica Neue</span><strong class="en">A line.<br>A living form.</strong><p>Helvetica Neue · Light / Regular<br>0123456789 — SILVER × AUREUS</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap" id="prototype"><div class="section-head reveal"><div class="eyebrow">02 / Natural origin</div><h2>一抹金斑，<br>是形态的起点。<small>自然档案 / 金斑喙凤蝶</small></h2></div><div class="archive"><figure class="reveal"><div class="nature-photo sweep"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="金斑喙凤蝶停栖于植物上，后翅可见黄色斑块" loading="lazy"><span class="photo-label">FIELD RECORD / TEINOPALPUS AUREUS</span></div><figcaption class="caption">金斑喙凤蝶实拍 · 图片来源：<a href="https://www.forestry.gov.cn/c/www/dfdt/588367.jhtml" target="_blank" rel="noopener">国家林业和草原局 / 广东省林业局 ↗</a></figcaption></figure><div class="archive-copy reveal"><span class="eyebrow muted">Specimen study / 001</span><div class="latin-title">Teinopalpus<br>aureus</div><p>金斑喙凤蝶，鳞翅目、凤蝶科、喙凤属。雄蝶后翅的金黄色斑块，是本项目浅金色针迹的自然参照。</p><p class="muted">设计提取蝶翼的对称关系、舒展的翼形与局部金斑，再以横向针迹重新组织。图形是设计转译，不作为物种鉴定图。</p><dl class="facts"><div class="fact"><dt>保护级别</dt><dd>国家一级</dd></div><div class="fact"><dt>生境参照</dt><dd>常绿阔叶林</dd></div><div class="fact"><dt>视觉提取</dt><dd>对称 · 翼形 · 金斑</dd></div></dl></div></div><p class="big-quote reveal">从自然中借取<em>形态</em>，<br>而非复制自然的每一处细节。</p></section>
<section class="section craft-section" id="craft"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head reveal"><div class="eyebrow">03 / Material memory</div><h2>银有冷光，<br>手有温度。<small>苗族银饰 / 刺绣走线</small></h2></div><div class="craft-grid"><figure class="reveal"><div class="silver-photo sweep"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="苗族银饰项圈与垂坠饰件，展示精细线性结构" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption class="caption">苗族银饰 · 摄影：雷安平 / 中国非物质文化遗产网<br>此处以黑白展示，聚焦结构与金属反射。</figcaption></figure><div class="craft-right reveal"><figure><div class="craft-photo"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="银匠使用工具在银片上錾刻的工艺现场" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption class="caption">錾刻 · 摄影：陈中贵 / 中国非物质文化遗产网</figcaption></figure><h3 style="margin:28px 0 20px">提取工艺的语言。</h3><p>苗族银饰制作包含捶打、拉丝、编结与錾刻等工序。银丝的连续、银片的凹凸与手工留下的微小差异，构成这一视觉系统的材质参照。</p><p class="muted">刺绣提供走线的方向、间距与节奏；银饰提供冷光与反射。两者在设计中相遇，成为有秩序、也有触感的针迹。</p><div class="craft-words"><div><span>银线</span><small>DRAWING</small></div><div><span>錾刻</span><small>CHASING</small></div><div><span>针迹</span><small>STITCHING</small></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap generation" id="generation"><div class="section-head reveal"><div class="eyebrow">04 / Form generation</div><h2>不是画一只蝶。<br>是让针迹成为蝶。<small>方向 × 长度 × 密度</small></h2></div><div class="generate-layout"><div class="reveal"><article class="step active" data-step="0"><span class="num">01</span><div><h3>提取 / Stitch</h3><p>把一针一线抽象成横向单元，保留走线的节奏。</p></div></article><article class="step" data-step="1"><span class="num">02</span><div><h3>重构 / Structure</h3><p>改变针迹的长度与排列，让翼形从疏密关系中生长。</p></div></article><article class="step" data-step="2"><span class="num">03</span><div><h3>材质化 / Reflection</h3><p>以银灰建立层次，让浅金与高光落在局部针迹上。</p></div></article><p class="caption" style="margin-top:25px">拖动滑杆，观察从走线到蝶形的转变。<br>此交互为基于原始主视觉的动态推导示意。</p></div><div class="reveal"><div class="generate-stage"><span class="stage-label eyebrow">Stitching system</span><canvas id="generate-canvas" role="img" aria-label="针迹逐步重组为用户原始蝶形"></canvas><span class="stage-state en" id="stage-state" aria-live="polite">01 / STITCH</span></div><label class="range-wrap" for="evolution"><span>走线</span><input id="evolution" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="0" aria-label="蝶形生成进度"><span>蝶形</span></label></div></div></section>
<section class="section pack-section" id="packaging"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head reveal"><div class="eyebrow">05 / Beyond the wings</div><h2>一只蝶，<br>不止一种展开。<small>包装与家具家居 / CONCEPT EDITION</small></h2></div><div class="pack-top reveal"><p>完整蝶形成为主款，翼部裁切形成系列。让针迹越过边界，在纸面上延续银饰的微光。</p><div class="materials" aria-label="包装材质"><button aria-pressed="true" data-material="silver">01 冷银烫印</button><button aria-pressed="false" data-material="emboss">02 纸面压印</button></div></div><div class="package-scene reveal" id="packages" aria-label="三款系列包装概念样机"><div class="box"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="完整蝶形主款礼盒" loading="lazy"><div class="box-label">蝶映穗城<small>SILVER × AUREUS<br>THE COMPLETE FORM</small></div><span class="box-num">NO. 01 / 蝶</span></div><div class="box"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="上翼局部裁切包装" loading="lazy"><div class="box-label">蝶映穗城<small>THE UPPER WING</small></div><span class="box-num">NO. 02 / 翼</span></div><div class="box"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="下翼针迹局部包装" loading="lazy"><div class="box-label">蝶映穗城<small>THE SILVER LINE</small></div><span class="box-num">NO. 03 / 迹</span></div></div><div class="pack-meta"><span id="material-description" aria-live="polite">哑光米白纸 × 冷银烫印 × 局部浅金</span><span>包装与工艺效果为概念示意</span></div><div class="crop-grid reveal"><figure><div class="crop"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="主视觉上翼的放大裁切" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption>01 / 翼部 · 延展轮廓</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="crop"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="主视觉金色针迹局部" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption>02 / 金斑 · 保留识别</figcaption></figure><figure><div class="crop"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="主视觉细密银灰针迹局部" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption>03 / 针迹 · 构成肌理</figcaption></figure></div><article class="application reveal"><div class="application-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">STATIONERY & CULTURAL GIFTS</p><h3>收藏一段蝶影。</h3></div><p>把蝶翼上的针迹带入书写、赠礼与收藏。完整蝶形与局部裁切，在同一套纸品中彼此呼应。</p></div><figure><div class="application-visual sweep"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="收藏一段蝶影。把蝶翼上的针迹带入书写、赠礼与收藏。完整蝶形与局部裁切，在同一套纸品中彼此呼应。" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024"></div><figcaption class="caption">蝶映穗城 · 系列应用概念效果图 / 来自项目展板</figcaption></figure><div class="application-details"><div><h4>赠礼 / Gift</h4><p>礼盒与手提袋，建立完整的视觉识别。</p></div><div><h4>书写 / Write</h4><p>笔记本、明信片与笔，让针迹进入日常。</p></div><div><h4>收藏 / Keep</h4><p>金属书签，以冷银表面承接细密走线。</p></div></div></article><article class="application reveal"><div class="application-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">FURNITURE & LIVING</p><h3>让针迹进入空间。</h3></div><p>从纸面上的线，延伸为织物上的针脚和空间中的银灰结构。让同一只蝶，在不同尺度里展开。</p></div><figure><div class="application-visual sweep"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="让针迹进入空间。从纸面上的线，延伸为织物上的针脚和空间中的银灰结构。让同一只蝶，在不同尺度里展开。" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024"></div><figcaption class="caption">蝶映穗城 · 系列应用概念效果图 / 来自项目展板</figcaption></figure><div class="application-details"><div><h4>屏风 / Screen</h4><p>三联屏风，将完整蝶形展开为空间界面。</p></div><div><h4>织物 / Textile</h4><p>坐凳与靠垫，以局部刺绣呈现翼部肌理。</p></div><div><h4>器物 / Objects</h4><p>边几、陶瓷杯与托盘，延续银灰与米白。</p></div></div></article></div></section>
<section class="closing wrap"><div class="closing-top reveal"><div><h2>以线为引。<br>向光而生。</h2><div class="eyebrow muted">DIE YING SUI CHENG / SILVER × AUREUS</div></div><a href="#home">回到第一根针迹 ↑</a></div><details class="sources"><summary>资料、图像与设计说明 ＋</summary><ul><li>主视觉：用户提供的《蝴蝶设计主视觉》，本页以内嵌原图呈现。动态生成与包装均由此图延展。</li><li>物种资料：<a href="https://www.forestry.gov.cn/c/www/dfdt/519657.jhtml" target="_blank" rel="noopener">国家林业和草原局：广西九万山保护区首次发现金斑喙凤蝶</a>；物种照片：<a href="https://www.forestry.gov.cn/c/www/dfdt/588367.jhtml" target="_blank" rel="noopener">广东车八岭保护区记录</a>。</li><li>银饰与工艺图文：<a href="https://www.ihchina.cn/project_details/9874" target="_blank" rel="noopener">中国非物质文化遗产网《苗族银饰锻制技艺》</a>。图3 摄影：雷安平；图7 摄影：陈中贵。外部照片版权归原作者，作为此 demo 的研究参考使用。</li><li>标准字体为思源黑体与 Helvetica Neue；本文件优先使用本机字体，缺失时回退至苹方、微软雅黑或 Arial。未将商业字体打包。包装为设计概念，实际烫印与压印效果需打样确认。</li></ul></details><div class="footer-line"><span>蝶映穗城 / 数字设计展览</span><span>2026 · CONCEPT STUDY</span></div></section></main>
